# Async and cancellation

Pass the request cancellation token from gRPC or GraphQL through the mediator into EF and downstream service calls.

Await the operation when the method processes its result, performs subsequent work or handles errors around the asynchronous call. A forwarding method can return a compatible task directly. A gRPC override that only forwards a Mediator `ValueTask<T>` can return `Send(...).AsTask()`.
